  subgraph P03["3 - BILLING &amp; ACTIVATION - Paddle -&gt; tenant goes live"]
    direction TB
    P3_choose["<b>Choose a plan in the Paywall</b><br/><i>trial / standard / premium plus an optional referral code. Trial is 3 days and 50 minutes; standard is 200 min ($299); premium is 500 min ($399).</i>"]
    P3_checkout["<b>POST /api/checkout/paddle</b><br/><i>The plan name is mapped to a PADDLE_*_PRICE_ID environment variable on the SERVER, so a client cannot post a cheaper price id. custom_data carries clerk_user_id, plan, ref and business_name.</i>"]
