    P10_sms["<b>Customer texts your number</b><br/><i>POST /api/webhooks/twilio/sms-inbound (signature verified). The same handler serves WhatsApp: the whatsapp: prefix is detected, stripped and re-applied on the way out, and the channel is recorded per message.</i>"]
